{
  "declaredLength": 6612,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Meh. Esta Luminalia Dimensional tampoco\nes nada del otro mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00650068002E002000450073007400610020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C00690061002000440069006D0065006E00730069006F006E0061006C002000740061006D0070006F0063006F000A006500730020006E006100640061002000640065006C0020006F00740072006F0020006D0075006E0064006F002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estoy de acuerdo. No son más que edificios\nnormales como los de nuestro mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Señor Corax!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006500F1006F007200200043006F007200610078002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Señor Corax!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006500F1006F007200200043006F007200610078002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué quieres?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E900200071007500690065007200650073003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aún no pude agradecerle por la propina\nque me dio. Me sirvió muchísimo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npara cancelar mi deuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aún no pude agradecerle por la propina\nque me dio. Me sirvió muchísimo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npara cancelar mi deuda.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quien endeuda su dinero se endeuda a sí mismo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNo me pareció bien que no estuviéramos en\nigualdad de condiciones. Por eso lo hice, ya está.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero, ya que están aquí, díganme: ¿les gustaría\nun combate contra nosotros dos?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo encantado! ¿Qué dices, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059006F00200065006E00630061006E007400610064006F0021002000BF0051007500E9002000640069006300650073002C00200010000201000000003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo encantada! ¿Qué te parece, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059006F00200065006E00630061006E00740061006400610021002000BF0051007500E90020007400650020007000610072006500630065002C00200010000201000000003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Claro!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006C00610072006F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No lo sé...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020006C006F0020007300E9002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vamos, no conviene hacer esperar al señor Corax.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00560061006D006F0073002C0020006E006F00200063006F006E007600690065006E00650020006800610063006500720020006500730070006500720061007200200061006C00200073006500F1006F007200200043006F007200610078002E00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No me hace mucha gracia hacer esperar\nal señor Corax, sinceramente.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020006D0065002000680061006300650020006D0075006300680061002000670072006100630069006100200068006100630065007200200065007300700065007200610072000A0061006C00200073006500F1006F007200200043006F007200610078002C002000730069006E0063006500720061006D0065006E00740065002E00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estás con el líder del Equipo MZ. ¡Es imposible\nque perdamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E1007300200063006F006E00200065006C0020006C00ED006400650072002000640065006C002000450071007500690070006F0020004D005A002E002000A10045007300200069006D0070006F007300690062006C0065000A007100750065002000700065007200640061006D006F0073002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Estás con la líder del Equipo MZ. ¡Es imposible\nque perdamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2264,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007400E1007300200063006F006E0020006C00610020006C00ED006400650072002000640065006C002000450071007500690070006F0020004D005A002E002000A10045007300200069006D0070006F007300690062006C0065000A007100750065002000700065007200640061006D006F0073002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero estar a la altura de mi Scolipede.\n¿Y? ¿Vamos a combatir o qué?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero demostrarle de nuevo al señor Corax que\npuede confiar en mí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006900650072006F002000640065006D006F00730074007200610072006C00650020006400650020006E007500650076006F00200061006C00200073006500F1006F007200200043006F0072006100780020007100750065000A0070007500650064006500200063006F006E006600690061007200200065006E0020006D00ED002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Combatamos!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006D0062006100740061006D006F007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un poco",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E00200070006F0063006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Apúrate! ¡Que mi tiempo es oro!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041007000FA00720061007400650021002000A10051007500650020006D00690020007400690065006D0070006F0020006500730020006F0072006F002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Esta vez no tendré piedad!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045007300740061002000760065007A0020006E006F002000740065006E0064007200E90020007000690065006400610064002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Esperaré lo que haga falta. Tengo nervios de\nacero.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500730070006500720061007200E90020006C006F002000710075006500200068006100670061002000660061006C00740061002E002000540065006E0067006F0020006E0065007200760069006F0073002000640065000A0061006300650072006F002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No me voy a dejar vencer tan fácil. La reputación\ndel señor Corax está en juego.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El señor Corax y Albado están esperando.\n¡Vamos a combatir de una vez!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El señor Corax y Albado están esperando.\n¡Vamos a combatir de una vez!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Scolipede! ¡Contigo a mi lado puedo seguir\nsonriendo aunque esté entre la espada y la pared!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡La megaevolución refleja el lazo que nos une!\n¡Admiren la verdadera belleza de mi Skarmory!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Combatir junto a ti me motiva a superar mis\nlímites!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006D006200610074006900720020006A0075006E0074006F002000610020007400690020006D00650020006D006F007400690076006100200061002000730075007000650072006100720020006D00690073000A006C00ED006D0069007400650073002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Combatir junto a ti me motiva a superar mis\nlímites!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006F006D006200610074006900720020006A0075006E0074006F002000610020007400690020006D00650020006D006F007400690076006100200061002000730075007000650072006100720020006D00690073000A006C00ED006D0069007400650073002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡El combate contra el señor Corax y Albado\nestuvo increíble!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006C00200063006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E00740072006100200065006C00200073006500F1006F007200200043006F0072006100780020007900200041006C006200610064006F000A00650073007400750076006F00200069006E00630072006500ED0062006C0065002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡El combate contra el señor Corax y Albado\nestuvo increíble!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045006C00200063006F006D006200610074006500200063006F006E00740072006100200065006C00200073006500F1006F007200200043006F0072006100780020007900200041006C006200610064006F000A00650073007400750076006F00200069006E00630072006500ED0062006C0065002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por algo fueron los mejores en los Juegos Z-A.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY nosotros aún tenemos que aprender a\ncompenetrarnos mejor.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 114
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Perdimos a causa de mi incompetencia.\nLo siento mucho, señor Corax.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500065007200640069006D006F0073002000610020006300610075007300610020006400650020006D006900200069006E0063006F006D0070006500740065006E006300690061002E000A004C006F0020007300690065006E0074006F0020006D007500630068006F002C00200073006500F1006F007200200043006F007200610078002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tonterías, Albado. Lo hiciste muy bien\ny te estoy tan agradecido como siempre.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y ahora vayamos a finiquitar esto, que no hay\nmanera de perderlos de vista ni aunque me vaya<U+0010><U+0001>븀\na otra dimensión, literalmente.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Toma esto. Aunque te pido un favor a cambio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F006D00610020006500730074006F002E002000410075006E0071007500650020007400650020007000690064006F00200075006E0020006600610076006F007200200061002000630061006D00620069006F002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recibiste el Traje de Corax.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006300690062006900730074006500200065006C0020005400720061006A006500200064006500200043006F007200610078002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Desde hace un tiempo, nuestros dos grupos\nse ven cercanos al ojo público.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pero no te equivoques. Todo el mundo sabe\nque con el Clan Corrosión no se juega.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNosotros no dudamos en hundir en el agua al\nMagikarp que osa saltar fuera o en arrancarle<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nla piel al Ekans que intenta mudarla.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 219
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tenemos una reputación que mantener.\nAsí que ojo con lo que haces y dices por ahí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ciudad Luminalia me acogió y me hizo quien soy.\nSe lo debo todo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006900750064006100640020004C0075006D0069006E0061006C006900610020006D0065002000610063006F0067006900F3002000790020006D0065002000680069007A006F00200071007500690065006E00200073006F0079002E000A005300650020006C006F0020006400650062006F00200074006F0064006F002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que no me entere de que estás asustando a\nla gente haciéndote pasar por el jefe.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Los combates Pokémon son geniales!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
